<title>JAPAN: Omron - 6mth group results.</title>
<headline>Omron - 6mth group results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		266.30		vs	  244.84</p>
<p> Operating	   15.49		vs	   16.82</p>
<p> Current	     14.73		vs	   15.63</p>
